Derived data produced by this code (outputs/tables/) are released under CC BY 4.0. Tables built from BBS or TCB
sources contain only summary statistics (e.g. correlations, reliabilities); the underlying BBS and TCB series are
not redistributed and are regenerated locally by the scripts. Short excerpts of published BBS CPI tables and TCB
price bulletins appear in tests/test_bbs.py and tests/test_tcb.py as parser test values, with acknowledgement of
the source (Bangladesh Bureau of Statistics; Trading Corporation of Bangladesh); they are not covered by the MIT or
CC BY 4.0 grants. Third-party source data keep their own terms: see data/raw/LICENSES.md (World Bank RTFP: CC BY
4.0 with World Bank terms; WFP/HDX: CC BY-IGO 3.0; BBS and TCB: no licence stated, download scripts only).
